        "introduction": {
          "": null,
          "kicker": "Lunch and learn with O3",
          "kicker_tag": "div",
          "title": "About ",
          "heading_level": "h2",
          "heading_tag": "div",
          "add_description": true,
          "description": "With a particular focus on enhancing the customer experience (CX), O3 lunch and learn sessions are meticulously crafted to empower your team with the latest insights and expertise. Our experts are not only pioneers but also thought leaders, guiding companies through the ever-evolving opportunities within generative AI and Large Language Models (LLMs). It's become evident that tools like ChatGPT will play a pivotal role in shaping your business landscape in 2024. Get ahead and provide your team with a personalized deep dive into the intricacies of how this technology will transform the customer experience."
        },
        "introduction_link": "",
        "column": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Key areas of focus</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>History of AI, the rise of generative AI and LLMs</li>\n<li>How AI impacts your customer or employee experience</li>\n<li>Key use cases, products, and processes for leveraging AI</li>\n<li>A strategic framework for aligning business objectives with effective AI solutions</li>\n<li>Real-life case studies of AI in action including pitfalls and future opportunities</li>\n</ul>\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Details</h4>\n<p>With a duration of 1 hour and accommodating 8–12 participants, our lunch and learn format is flexible—available in-person or virtually. All we need from you is a high-level understanding of your business and pain points.</p>\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
